===Etymology===
From {{etyl|ar|en}} {{term|قِبْلَة||which is opposite|tr=qíbla|lang=ar}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈkɪblə/|lang=en}}, {{IPA|/ˈqibla/|lang=en}} {{qualifier|as Arabic}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|~}}

# {{context|Islam|lang=en}} The [[direction]] in which [[Muslim]]s face while [[praying]], now the [[Kaaba]] in [[Mecca]].

